[3.12, "o", "- Commands: the commands of stages 1 to 6 of the install guide, then `launch-main.sh`, `/login` inside Pi, a prompt of one line, then `pi --version` with the profile\r\n"]
[3.17, "o", "- Result: check 1 passed, Pi prints 1.0.2. Check 2 passed, Pi starts with no extension error and no peer warning. Check 3 passed, the model gave a reply to a prompt of one line. Check 4 passed, Pi wrote into the target only. Checks 5 and 6 not run, no memory module and no `mcp`.\r\n"]
